{"id":"f92b2b6a2706404b","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-p-morphism.md","title":"P-Morphism","display":"df-p-morphism — P-Morphism","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-p-morphism","aliases":["89-df-p-morphism","p-morphism","有界态射","bounded morphism"],"display":"df-p-morphism — P-Morphism","depends_on":["[[89-df-kripke-frame]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-p-morphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-p-morphism</span><span>p-morphism</span><span>有界态射</span><span>bounded morphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-p-morphism — P-Morphism"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c78d4bf1505bda5c\" href=\"?note=c78d4bf1505bda5c\" title=\"89-df-kripke-frame\">89-df-kripke-frame</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-p-morphism-—-P-Morphism-$f$\">df-p-morphism — P-Morphism <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F} = (W, R)\">\\(\\mathcal{F} = (W, R)\\)</span> (Kripke frame, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c78d4bf1505bda5c\" href=\"?note=c78d4bf1505bda5c\" title=\"89-df-kripke-frame\">89-df-kripke-frame</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}&#39; = (W&#39;, R&#39;)\">\\(\\mathcal{F}&#39; = (W&#39;, R&#39;)\\)</span> (Kripke frame)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f: W \\rightarrow W&#39;\">\\(f: W \\rightarrow W&#39;\\)</span> (mapping, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c78d4bf1505bda5c\" href=\"?note=c78d4bf1505bda5c\" title=\"89-df-kripke-frame\">89-df-kripke-frame</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{pMorphism}(f;\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F&#39;)\">\\(\\mathrm{pMorphism}(f;\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F&#39;)\\)</span> 是下述定义的三元有界态射谓词，参数为映射、源框架与目标框架。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}p\\text{-}morphism}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{pMorphism}(f;\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F&#39;)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;f:W\\twoheadrightarrow W&#39;\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall w,v\\in W\\;(wRv\\to f(w)R&#39;f(v))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall w\\in W\\;\\forall u&#39;\\in W&#39;\\;\n(f(w)R&#39;u&#39;\\to\\exists v\\in W\\;(wRv\\land f(v)=u&#39;))\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}p\\text{-}morphism}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{pMorphism}(f;\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F&#39;)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;f:W\\twoheadrightarrow W&#39;\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall w,v\\in W\\;(wRv\\to f(w)R&#39;f(v))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall w\\in W\\;\\forall u&#39;\\in W&#39;\\;\n(f(w)R&#39;u&#39;\\to\\exists v\\in W\\;(wRv\\land f(v)=u&#39;))\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> : 满射 p-态射（有界态射）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f[\\mathcal{F}]\">\\(f[\\mathcal{F}]\\)</span> : p-态射图像</li>\n</ul>\n<p>p-态射是模态逻辑中的&quot;结构保持映射&quot;：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>p-态射保持模态公式的有效性</li>\n<li>p-态射可以用于分析框架性质</li>\n<li>p-态射是研究模态逻辑的重要工具</li>\n</ul>\n<p>p-态射性质：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 是p-态射且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F} \\models \\varphi\">\\(\\mathcal{F} \\models \\varphi\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f[\\mathcal{F}] \\models \\varphi\">\\(f[\\mathcal{F}] \\models \\varphi\\)</span></li>\n<li>p-态射保持框架的有界性质</li>\n<li>p-态射可以用于简化框架</li>\n</ul>\n<p>p-态射与双模拟的关系：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>p-态射是框架间的映射</li>\n<li>双模拟是模型间的关系</li>\n<li>p-态射图像与原模型双模拟</li>\n</ul>\n<p>相关概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f233d5485efaad7c\" href=\"?note=f233d5485efaad7c\" title=\"89-df-bisimulation\">89-df-bisimulation</a>：p-态射与双模拟相关</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4505fdbef0375a48\" href=\"?note=4505fdbef0375a48\" title=\"89-df-generated-submodel\">89-df-generated-submodel</a>：生成子框架有自然p-态射</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c6ab46cd662b1409\" href=\"?note=c6ab46cd662b1409\" title=\"89-df-gl-frame\">89-df-gl-frame</a>：GL框架的p-态射保持逆良基性</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3a019df3a337399a\" href=\"?note=3a019df3a337399a\" title=\"89-prop-p-morphism-preserves\">89-prop-p-morphism-preserves</a>：p-态射保持有效性</li>\n</ul>\n<p>参考文献：Boolos, George. <em>The Logic of Provability</em>. Chapter 2.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-p-morphism-—-P-Morphism-$f$","text":"df-p-morphism — P-Morphism $f$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-kripke-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c78d4bf1505bda5c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-kripke-frame]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-kripke-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c78d4bf1505bda5c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal{F} = (W, R)$ (Kripke frame, see [[89-df-kripke-frame]])","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-kripke-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c78d4bf1505bda5c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f: W \\rightarrow W'$ (mapping, see [[89-df-kripke-frame]])","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-bisimulation","status":"resolved","id":"f233d5485efaad7c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[89-df-bisimulation]]：p-态射与双模拟相关","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-generated-submodel","status":"resolved","id":"4505fdbef0375a48","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[89-df-generated-submodel]]：生成子框架有自然p-态射","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c6ab46cd662b1409","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-frame]]：GL框架的p-态射保持逆良基性","embed":false},{"target":"89-prop-p-morphism-preserves","status":"resolved","id":"3a019df3a337399a","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[89-prop-p-morphism-preserves]]：p-态射保持有效性","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{F} = (W, R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{F}' = (W', R')","display":false},{"tex":"f: W \\rightarrow W'","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{pMorphism}(f;\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F')","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}p\\text{-}morphism}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{pMorphism}(f;\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F')\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\begin{aligned}\n&f:W\\twoheadrightarrow W'\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall w,v\\in W\\;(wRv\\to f(w)R'f(v))\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall w\\in W\\;\\forall u'\\in W'\\;\n(f(w)R'u'\\to\\exists v\\in W\\;(wRv\\land f(v)=u'))\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"f[\\mathcal{F}]","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{F} \\models \\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"f[\\mathcal{F}] \\models \\varphi","display":false}],"bytes":1918,"backlinks":[{"id":"3a019df3a337399a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f$ : p-态射 (see [[89-df-p-morphism]])"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-101","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-4-axiom.md]]\n[[89-df-accessibility.md]]\n[[89-df-arithmetical-interpretat